WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.450
Imagine studying for years for one exam.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.440
Pass, and you could help run an empire.

3
00:00:06.490 --> 00:00:08.930
In Song China, that was real.

4
00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:12.920
Officials were chosen by exams
on the Confucian classics.

5
00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:16.040
And those books were full
of advice about family.

6
00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:19.900
One saying warns: feeding
your parents is not enough,

7
00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:22.120
even animals are fed.

8
00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:26.930
So why would an empire test its officials
on ancient books about family and good

9
00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:28.250
conduct?

10
00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:32.030
In this mission, you'll meet
Confucius and the virtues he taught,

11
00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:34.940
from humaneness to respect for parents.

12
00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:39.330
Then you'll follow these ideas as they
changed over time and spread across East

13
00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:40.360
Asia.

14
00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:45.810
Your mission: explain why China tested its
officials on ancient books about family

15
00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:46.990
and good conduct.
